        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GVCPRT, Grande Victorian Plate With Portofino Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Grande Victorian Plate With Portofino Lever is reminiscent of the late 1800's door hardware styles. Fit for royalty, it has an elaborate yet graceful victorian design. The Grande Victorian Plate features luxurious detailing that exudes richness. The Portofino Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. This leverset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home décors. This Grandeur Interior Set will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-grande-victorian-series\"><b>Grande Victorian Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grande Victorian Plate With Portofino Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur GVCPRT Grande Victorian Plate With Portofino Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Height: 8.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GVC-plate.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Grande Victorian Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRT-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Portofino Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grande Victorian Plate With Portofino Lever, Grandeur GVCPRT",
                "description": "Grande Victorian Plate With Portofino Lever Grandeur GVCPRT - The Grande Victorian Plate With Portofino Lever is reminiscent of the late 1800's door hardware styles. Fit for royalty, it has an elaborate yet graceful victorian design. The Grande Victorian Plate features luxurious detailing that exudes richness. Portofino Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. This leverset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home décors. This Grandeur Interior Set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
